   <div id=\"main_sidebar\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"main_content\">\n\n            <div id=\"header_links\" class=\"actions\">\n<div class=\"css_button\" id=\"btn_online_application_back\">\n<a title=\"Execute button named Back\" aria-label=\"Execute button named Back\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/\" onclick=\"\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"\">Back</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"css_button\" id=\"btn_online_application\">\n<a title=\"Execute button named Apply now!\" aria-label=\"Execute button named Apply now!\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/IT-Application-Owner-Atlassian-Tools-mfd-eng-f1577.html\" onclick=\"\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apply now!</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"pageframework_content\">\n<div id=\"jobTplContainer\" class=\"ck_content\"><div class=\"scheme-display\"><div class=\"scheme-border\"><div class=\"scheme-content scheme-title\"><h1 style=\"color: #8abe0e\" >IT Application Owner Atlassian Tools (m/f/d)</h1></div><div class=\"scheme-content content-images\"><img class=\"slide-images\" data-slide-index=\"1\" alt=\"IT Application Owner Atlassian Tools (m/f/d), 1. image\" src=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/inc/display_image.php?id=1577-HO-1-ENG&amp;type=tmp\" /></div></div><div class=\"scheme-content scheme-margin scheme-introduction\"><h2 style=\"color: #8abe0e\"  class=\"scheme-headline\" ></h2><div class=\"content_text\" ><p>Deutsche Pfandbriefbank AG (pbb) is an international specialized commercial bank with over 800 employees from 37 countries. We offer our customers a wide range of financing and investment solutions for the entire real estate value chain. Our goal is to contribute to a more sustainable world of real estate.</p>\n<p>For our CIO/COO business area based in Madrid, we are currently seeking to hire, with immediate effect, an</p>\n<h1>IT Application Owner Atlassian Tools (m/f/d)</h1></div></div><div class=\"scheme-content scheme-margin scheme-task\"><h2 style=\"color: #8abe0e\"  class=\"scheme-headline\" >Your tasks</h2><div class=\"content_text\" ><ul>\n<li>You support the operational and technical management of Jira and Confluence as well as bitbucket</li>\n<li>You develop new workflows, customizations and automations for Jira and Confluence Data Center and Cloud</li>\n<li>You are responsible for the application management of other standard applications</li>\n<li>You ensure stability, security, performance, maintenance and compliance with internal standards in coordination with the software provider and relevant stakeholders for the applications in your responsibility</li>\n<li>You manage incidents, vulnerabilities, changes, upgrades and releases in coordination with the software providers and relevant stakeholders</li>\n<li>You coordinate projects and participate actively in new initiatives regarding the applications you are responsible for</li>\n<li>You drive continuous improvement by identifying optimization opportunities and implementing sustainable solutions</li>\n</ul></div></div><div class=\"scheme-content scheme-margin scheme-profile\"><h2 style=\"color: #8abe0e\"  class=\"scheme-headline\" >How to convince us</h2><div class=\"content_text\" ><ul>\n<li>2 - 5 years of proven experience in Application Management, Application Support, or IT Operations, as well as IT Project Management, ideally in the financial services industry</li>\n<li>Experience with Jira, Confluence and Bitbucket Data Center and/or Cloud</li>\n<li>Experience with Jira/Confluence groovy scripting and Jira automation (Data Center and/or Cloud)</li>\n<li>Knowledge of databases (Oracle, MSSQL), SQL, Windows/Linux Server OS and role-based access control concepts</li>\n<li>Excellent communication, analytical and problem-solving skills, with fluent English and the ability to work independently in an international environment</li>\n<li>Willingness to travel within EU from time to time</li>\n<li>Knowledge of the German Language is an advantage</li>\n</ul></div></div><div class=\"scheme-content scheme-margin scheme-benefits\"><h2 style=\"color: #8abe0e\"  class=\"scheme-headline\" >Our values</h2><div class=\"content_text\" ><p>We live our values and expect the same attitude from our employees. Together, we are future-oriented, reliable, and collaborative. </p>\n<h2>What you can expect</h2>\n<p><br />With us, you will encounter a sustainable corporate culture, diverse and challenging projects, as well as plenty of creative freedom and flexibility. </p>\n<p>And what else?</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compelling compensation &amp; great benefits</li>\n<li>Family-friendly working conditions with at least two days remote working</li>\n<li>Attractive, easy-to-reach locations </li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>Sounds exciting? </strong></h2>\n<p>So let's shape the future of real estate together. Apply now to join #teampbb in just a few clicks!</p></div></div></div><style>#content_zone {\nmax-width: 834px;\n}\n#scheme_detail_data {\nwidth:100%;\ndisplay:table;\nmargin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.scheme-border {\nborder: 1px solid rgba(220,223,226,0.8);\n}\n.scheme-margin {\nmargin-top: 10px;\n}\n.scheme-display .scheme-content {\nfont-size: 16px;\npadding: 14px 24px;\nbackground-color: #ffffff;\nline-height: 1.6;\n}\n.scheme-display .scheme-title {\nword-break: break-word;\n}\n.scheme-display .scheme-title h2 {\nmargin: 0px;\nfont-size: 28px;\nline-height: 2;\npadding: 0px;\n}\n.scheme-display .scheme-title ul {\nmargin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.scheme-display .video {\nwidth: 100%;\nheight: 400px;\n}\n.scheme-display h2.scheme-headline {\nmargin: 0px 0px 18px 0px;\npadding: 0px;\n}\n.scheme-display .content-images {\nposition: relative;\noverflow: hidden;\ndisplay: block;\nbox-sizing: border-box;\npadding: 0px;\n}\n.scheme-display .content-images:not(:has(.content-images-frame)) {\nheight: 335px;\n}\n#header_image {\ndisplay: none;\n}\n#jobTplContainer ul.scheme-additional-data  {\nmargin-bottom: 0px;\nmin-width: 40%;\n}\n.scheme-additional-data {\nfloat: left;\nmargin: 0;\npadding: 0;\nlist-style: none